WEBVTT

00:41:26.829 --> 00:41:32.246
Well, maybe giving the tools to that sort
of AI terrorist in his bedroom somewhere,

00:41:32.913 --> 00:41:36.871
I think I think we got misunderstood in
the way we were talking about that.

00:41:37.163 --> 00:41:41.538
We certainly don't think that the
right thing to do is to, like,

00:41:41.538 --> 00:41:45.829
build this a super weapon and hand it to
a terrorist. That's obviously awful.

00:41:46.121 --> 00:41:50.204
One of the reasons that we like our
API model is it lets us make

00:41:50.204 --> 00:41:54.746
the most powerful AI technology anyone
in the world has, as far as we know,

00:41:54.996 --> 00:42:00.454
available to ever would like to use it,
but to put some controls on its usage.